  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c710770abf287dc46b346fe2f2467822, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: "Sweetness,\nMy calendar tells me that the next starry
    night is soon upon us. I'll be spending it with first timers. Regretably not
    all of them can attend to this beautiful display in the skies. \nCould you make
    some Crystal Dust so that we can all share a good time?\nHappy brewing,"
